Audit report — pi-goal-list-loop-audit, goal `20260917162420-clxu2i.md` ("Auditor bounded recovery").

Reviewed the durable objective (minimal title) against the 4-part verification contract. Prior 4 disapprovals are addressed: the initial `complete_goal` exhaustion path now ladders into the same bounded durable-retry envelope as the stored path.

Checks performed:
- Read `extensions/loops/goal-auditor-hooks.ts` (`auditorRetryPlan`, dispatch-expiry guard, thinking site) and `extensions/loops/goal-tools.ts` (initial-path `retryUntil`, thinking site, chain capture, capped/wait reasons).
- Read regression tests `tests/auditor-retry-callback.test.ts`, `tests/auditor-dispatch-horizon.test.ts`, `tests/behavioral-orchestrator.test.ts` (bounded-recovery test).
- Ran `tsc --noEmit` (clean), `git diff --check` (clean), focused `bun test` for dispatch-horizon + retry-callback (4 pass) and the behavioral bounded-recovery test (1 pass).
- Reject-class check: no test file spawns the whole runner (`bun test`/`npm test`) from inside the suite.

<evidence>
Item: after every configured auditor candidate fails, retries are spaced within a fixed recovery window with monotonic attempt numbers and no deadline/counter renewal (regression test pins the 2026-09-17T14:07 ledger sequence: exhausted selection + 5s uniform schedule + attempt:1 repetition)
Output:
tests/auditor-retry-callback.test.ts:
(pass) manual audit exhaustion retries through timer with fresh candidates and unchanged envelope [37365.97ms]
  assert.equal(second?.retryAttempts, 2, 'timer must not inherit manual origin and reset count to 1');
  assert.equal(second?.retryFirstAt, first?.retryFirstAt);
  assert.equal(second?.retryUntil, first?.retryUntil);
extensions/loops/goal-auditor-hooks.ts:776-782:
  const firstAtMs = Number.isFinite(firstMs) ? firstMs : now;
  const firstAt = new Date(firstAtMs).toISOString();
  const untilMs = claim.retryUntil && Number.isFinite(Date.parse(claim.retryUntil))
    ? Date.parse(claim.retryUntil)
    : firstAtMs + MAIN_MODEL_AUTO_RETRY_HORIZON_MS;
  const attempt = (claim.retryAttempts ?? 0) + 1;
tests/behavioral-orchestrator.test.ts:
(pass) bounded recovery: initial aggressive completion preserves its horizon and exhausted chain [10819.86ms]
  assert.equal(expired.pendingCompletion?.retryAttempts, pending.retryAttempts);
  assert.equal(readLedger(cwd).filter(entry => entry.type === 'audit_started').length, launchesBefore, "delayed first automatic retry never launches past expiry");
